      "body": "I close the issue, it has been fixed.\n\n> We should ether make the behavior well defined by adding the explicit check for 0 size, or comment out the test.\n\nI merged the PR https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/146201 which fixes the undefined behavior by adding `if (len == 0)` test.\n\n> The test was backported to 3.14.\n\nI also backported the change fixing the undefined behavior to 3.14, so we should be good.",
